travels.com/things-to-do-in-the-amalfi-coast/","https://leisurelylinds.com/best-things-to-do-on-the-amalfi-coast/","https://www.giannisboat.com/en/tour"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Ravello Festival","type":"festival","detail":"Ravello turns into the cultural heart of the coast each summer, with concerts staged on gardens and terraces high above the sea.","season":[7,8,9],"link":"https://amalficoast-travel.com/en-us/events/","evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":29,"urls":["https://amalficoast-travel.com/en-us/events/","https://www.salernolimo.com/en/post/events-and-festivals-on-the-amalfi-coast-summer-2026","https://villafiorentino.com/blog/festivals-and-traditions-on-the-amalfi-coast-unmissable-annual-events","https://www.meraviso.com/main-events-on-the-amalfi-coast-and-in-sorrento"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"July lemon festivals","type":"festival","detail":"Villages fete the PGI lemon each July: the Night of the Lemons in Massa Lubrense and the Dragonea sagra serve lemon dishes and homemade limoncello.","season":[7],"evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":29,"urls":["https://casamiatours.com/sagre-food-festivals-amalfi-coast/","https://www.travelamalficoast.it/en/the-amalfi-coast-pgi-lemon","https://www.brembatistores.com/default/blog/a-citrusy-celebration-the-lemon-festival-of-dragonea","https://sagr.it/en/campania/amalfi-coast"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Positano cliffside village and beaches","type":"experience","detail":"Wander the stacked pastel lanes down to the beach, one of the coast's signature scenes; nearby Atrani stays quieter and slower.","evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":29,"urls":["https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attractions-g187779-Activities-Amalfi_Coast_Province_of_Salerno_Campania.html","https://exploredbymarta.com/travel/italy/things-to-do-on-the-amalfi-coast/","https://joujoutravels.com/things-to-do-in-the-amalfi-coast/","https://nz.hotels.com/go/italy/amalfi-coast-things-to-do"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]}